{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12301070","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12301070","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1230107001:1":{"text":"그래, 알고 있네. 비켜주지 않겠나? 자네가 내 햇살을 가리고 있어서.","source_cn":"是的，我知道，但请先让让，你挡着我的阳光了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC55B2F7E938EA4E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1230107002:1":{"text":"점점 더 많은 사람이 옛 일터로 돌아와 돛을 묶고 있군. 매듭 묶는 법을 잊지 않았으면 좋겠는데.","source_cn":"越来越多人在重拾旧业，拴紧船帆。希望他们还没忘记水手结...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89522D5E2D6D2AED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230107003:1":{"text":"러스트 항에 다시 바쁜 나날들이 찾아오겠군!","source_cn":"锈锚港，又要回归它忙碌的日子喽！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDFB6124FFFB65FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:老渔夫罗塞尔":{"text":"나이 든 어부 로젤라","source":"老渔夫罗塞尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}